        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 7015-628, Economy Priced Aluminum 3-1/2 x 15 Pull Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size 3-1/2\" x 15\" door pull plate with 6\" round pull handle. Primarily used in restaurants, warehouses, factories and stores. Made of .050\" thick aluminum. Brushed aluminum with clear anodizing finish. Packaged with mounting hardware for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-7015-628_size.gif?v=1704354713\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 7015-628 Aluminum Push Plate\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/3-1-2-x-15-aluminum-push-plates-don-jo-70-628\"><b>3-1/2\" x 15\" Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEconomy priced for budget conscious projects, yet high quality .050\" thick solid non-rusting aluminum with 6\" handle.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 7015-628 Aluminum Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle  Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Center to Center (CTC): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Brushed Aluminum</b> with Clear Anodizing</li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7015-628.pdf?v=1704262309\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 7015-628 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> \r\n</p>",
